## 6. Deployment View

- Single Spring Boot application (default port `8080`), connecting to a MySQL instance (`portfolio_manager` schema), migrated via Flyway on startup (`spring.flyway.baseline-on-migrate=true`, `spring.jpa.hibernate.ddl-auto=validate` — Flyway owns the schema, Hibernate only validates it matches).
- Frontend is a separate Vite dev server / static build, pointed at the backend via `VITE_API_BASE_URL` (defaults to `/api`, implying a dev proxy or same-origin deploy).
- No CORS configuration or security filter chain was found in the uploaded source — confirm before exposing this beyond localhost.

